#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:19
msgid "Cesium Quickstart"
msgstr "Cesium 快速入门"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:20
msgid ""
"Cesium is a JavaScript library for creating 3D globes and 2D maps in a web "
"browser without any plugins. It uses WebGL for hardware-accelerated "
"graphics, and is cross-platform, cross-browser, and tuned for time-dynamic "
"data visualization."
msgstr ""
"Cesium 是一个 JavaScript 库，用于在网页浏览器中创建三维地球和二维地图，无需任"
"何插件。它使用 WebGL 进行硬件加速图形渲染，并且具有跨平台、跨浏览器的特性，同"
"时针对时态动态数据的可视化进行了优化。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:22
msgid ""
"This guide shows how to use the Cesium with the 3D (Globe), 2.5D (Columbus "
"View) and 2D (map)."
msgstr "本指南展示了如何将 Cesium 用于 3D（全球）、2.5D（哥伦布视图）和 2D（地图）。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:25
msgid "Contents"
msgstr "内容"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:28
msgid "Start Cesium"
msgstr "启动Cesium"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:30
msgid ""
"Open the browser and point it to "
"http://localhost/cesium/Apps/HelloWorld.html"
msgstr "打开浏览器，并将其指向 http://localhost/cesium/Apps/HelloWorld.html"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:33
msgid "Search for a location"
msgstr "搜索一个位置"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:34
msgid ""
"Click on the magnifying glass and type in the location you are looking for. "
"In the following display, we look for India."
msgstr "点击放大镜，输入您要查找的位置。在下面的演示中，我们查找的是印度。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rstNone
msgid "Cesium Searching Location"
msgstr "Cesium 搜索位置"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:41
msgid "Switch between 3D, 2.5D and 2D"
msgstr "切换 3D、2.5D 和 2D 视图"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:42
msgid ""
"Click on the wire framed globe icon to select your preferred view. Here the"
" 2.5D Columbus view has been selected."
msgstr "点击线框地球图标，选择您偏好的视图。此处已选中 2.5D 哥伦布视图。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rstNone
msgid "Cesium switching between 3D, 2.5D and 2D"
msgstr "Cesium 在 3D、2.5D 和 2D 之间切换"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:48
msgid "Now the 2D map is selected."
msgstr "现在已选中 2D 地图视图。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rstNone
#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rstNone
msgid "Cesium 2D map"
msgstr "Cesium 2D 地图"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:55
msgid "Select the Image layer"
msgstr "选择影像图层"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:56
msgid ""
"Click on the last icon and select a type of image service. Here the Natural"
" Earth II is selected and you can see how the map's image layer has changed."
msgstr ""
"点击最后一个图标，选择一种影像服务类型。此处已选中 Natural Earth II，您可以看"
"到地图的影像图层发生了变化。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:65
msgid "What next?"
msgstr "接下来呢？"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:66
msgid ""
"Watch our `video tutorials <https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLBk_Dtk-"
"_Tlm4STvXKFEdfUWylPemo-9V>`_."
msgstr ""
"观看我们的 `视频教程 <https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PLBk_Dtk-"
"_Tlm4STvXKFEdfUWylPemo-9V>`_。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:68
msgid "Read our written `tutorials <https://cesium.com/learn>`_."
msgstr "阅读我们的书面 `教程 <https://cesium.com/learn>`_。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:70
msgid ""
"You can develop some quick applications using the `Sandcastle website "
"<https://sandcastle.cesium.com/index.html>`_. Sandcastle is generally one of"
" the best ways to learn about Cesium, and all the code examples are useful "
"for this purpose."
msgstr ""
"您可以使用 `Sandcastle 网站 <https://sandcastle.cesium.com/index.html>`_ 开发"
"一些快速应用程序。Sandcastle 通常是学习 Cesium 的最佳途径之一，所有代码示例对"
"此目的都很有帮助。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:72
msgid ""
"The `Cesium Forum <https://community.cesium.com>`_ is a great place to "
"search for answers to common questions, and to raise questions that haven't "
"been asked before."
msgstr ""
"`Cesium 论坛 <https://community.cesium.com>`_ 是搜索常见问题答案以及提出前所"
"未有问题的一个好地方。"

#: ../../build/doc/quickstart/cesium_quickstart.rst:74
msgid ""
"In-depth documentation is available `locally <http://localhost/cesium/>`_ on"
" the OSGeoLive package."
msgstr "详细文档可在 OSGeoLive 包的 `本地 <http://localhost/cesium/>`_ 获取。"

